# Double Checking System Period

This scope computes the start and end dates for the operational period of the double-checking system.

```catala
declaration scope DoubleCheckingSystemPeriod:
  input application_start_date content date
  output system_period_start content date
  output system_period_end content date
```

## System Start Date

The system begins on the date the agreement is applied between the Parties.

```catala
scope DoubleCheckingSystemPeriod:
  date round down
  definition system_period_start equals application_start_date
```

## System End Date

The system is applicable until 31 December 2004.

```catala
scope DoubleCheckingSystemPeriod:
  definition system_period_end equals |2004-12-31|
```